 class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2581050/extras/f0383a0eaa6d18c62377ced2a2ee8673.poster.avif?t=1750932191\" width=500 height=182 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2581050/extras/f0383a0eaa6d18c62377ced2a2ee8673.webm?t=1750932191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Production: KAMITSUBAKI STUDIO<br>Development: Studio Lalala, Rocket Studio, Inc<br>Chart creation and support: HARDCORE TANO*C",
